title: Case Manager › Empty states › Nothing to show
route: /manager and /manager?tab=reviews
intro: Four places can run out of rows: the 'Being prepared' row (once opened), the tracker, the review list and the review-update tile. Each says why and offers one way out. Filters cause three of them. The fourth happens when every draft has been signed and sent.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Case Manager is open"
input i1 "Type a search that matches nothing (for example 'zzz'), or pick a level of care and payer that no case has"
process p1 "Every list is re-filtered at once"

group gPrep "Being prepared (open the folded row first; its summary then reads 'Nothing is being prepared' or '0 of 5 match the filters')"
  decision d1 "Are there any drafts waiting at all?"
  screen e1s "Icon of a folder\n'Nothing is being prepared'\n'Start a case and the agents take it from there.'\nButton 'Start a new case'"
  click c1 "Click 'Start a new case'"
  decision d2 "Do the page filters and the chip hide all of them?"
  screen e2s "Icon of a magnifier\n'No cases match these filters'\n'The filters hide every case being prepared. Clear them to see all 5.'\nButton 'Clear filters'"
  click c2 "Click 'Clear filters' in the opened row"
  process p2 "Chip goes back to 'All' and the page filters are cleared"
endgroup

group gTrack "Tracker"
  decision d3 "Does any tracker row match?"
  screen e3s "Four tiles show 0\n'No cases match'\n'The filters hide every case. Clear them to see all 56.'\nButton 'Clear filters'\nThe pager is hidden"
  click c3 "Click 'Clear filters'"
endgroup

group gRev "Reviews this week"
  decision d4 "Does any review match?"
  screen e4s "'Showing 0 of 47 reviews. The tiles count all 47.'\n'No reviews match'\n'The filters hide every review this week.'\nButton 'Clear filters'\nThe 'Ready to step down?' card is still there"
  click c4 "Click 'Clear filters'"
  screen e5s "Third tile reads 'nothing waiting on you'\nwhen no review needs an update"
endgroup

process p3 "Filters go back to their first options\nSearch box is emptied, lists are full again"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Filters › Search and filter both tabs"
goto g2 "Continues in: New case › Referral step"
process p4 "How drafts run out: sign and send every case in 'Being prepared' (5 at the start)\nThe header then reads '0 are still being prepared'"
process p5 "'Step-down plans' has no empty state\nThe folded row is simply not shown when no denial was accepted or the filters hide every plan"
end e1 "Lists show rows again"

s1 --> i1 --> p1
p1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| e1s --> c1 --> g2
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| e2s --> c2 --> p2 --> e1
d2 -->|No| e1
p1 --> d3
d3 -->|No| e3s --> c3 --> p3
d3 -->|Yes| e1
p1 --> d4
d4 -->|No| e4s --> c4 --> p3
d4 -->|Yes| e1
p3 --> e1
p3 -.-> g1
s1 -.-> p4
p4 -.-> d1
s1 -.-> e5s
d3 -.-> p5
